      "Answer": "",
      "Output": ""
     },
     {
      "Line": "4",
      "Number": "",
      "Answer": "12",
      "Output": ""
     },
     {
      "Line": "5",
      "Number": "13",
      "Answer": "",
      "Output": ""
     },
     {
      "Line": "6",
      "Number": "",
      "Answer": "",
      "Output": "13"
     }
    ]
   },
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity: Trace a Sequence</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Line 5 changes Number again. Why is the output 13, not 6?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>The lines run in order. By line 6, line 5 has already put 13 in Number.</p></div></details><div id=\"y11ty-embed-2\" class=\"lesson-embed\"></div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "write-lines",
   "label": "Your Turn: Write the Lines",
   "type": "short-answer-validation",
   "validatorId": "y11ty-write-lines",
   "validatorKey": "y11ty_write_lines",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Your Turn: Write the Lines</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why must the DECLARE line come first?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>The lines run in order. The variable must exist before INPUT can store a value in it.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Type each whole line.</p><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response is-line\"><label for=\"y11ty-write-lines-a\">(a) Declare a variable called Price that stores a number with a decimal point [1]</label><input id=\"y11ty-write-lines-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"write-lines-a\" aria-label=\"Your Turn: Write the Lines part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response is-line\"><label for=\"y11ty-write-lines-b\">(b) Take a value from the user and store it in Price [1]</label><input id=\"y11ty-write-lines-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"write-lines-b\" aria-label=\"Your Turn: Write the Lines part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response is-line\"><label for=\"y11ty-write-lines-c\">(c) Show the value of Price [1]</label><input id=\"y11ty-write-lines-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"write-lines-c\" aria-label=\"Your Turn: Write the Lines part c\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y11ty-write-lines-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y11ty-write-lines-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div>"
  },
