   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Plenary: Data Types Drill</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why practise with new values every time?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>If you can do it with any values, you really understand it.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\">The five types, choosing a type, INPUT and OUTPUT, and writing the lines. Your progress is saved.</p><div id=\"y11ty-plenary\"></div>"
